<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Support & Documentation - Verify My Collectible</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background: #f9fafb;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background: white;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-top: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    h3 {
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-top: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    p {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #4a4a4a;
    }
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .step {
      background: #f9fafb;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
    }
    .step-number {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #3b82f6;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }
    .feature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .feature-card {
      padding: 20px;
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #3b82f6;
    }
    .contact-section {
      background: #f0f9ff;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    ul {
      margin-left: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #4a4a4a;
    }
    code {
      background: #f3f4f6;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-family: 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Support & Documentation</h1>
    <p>Welcome to Verify My Collectible! This guide will help you get started and make the most of your collectible verification system.</p>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Getting Started</h2>

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">Step 1:</span>
        <strong>Install the App</strong> - Find Verify My Collectible in the Shopify App Store and click "Add app"
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">Step 2:</span>
        <strong>Choose a Plan</strong> - Select the subscription plan that fits your inventory size
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">Step 3:</span>
        <strong>Create Categories</strong> - Organize your collectibles into categories (e.g., "Trading Cards", "Autographs", "Limited Editions")
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">Step 4:</span>
        <strong>Add Items</strong> - Upload your collectible items with serial numbers, descriptions, and images
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">Step 5:</span>
        <strong>Share with Customers</strong> - Customers can now verify their collectibles using their serial numbers
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Key Features</h2>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Category Management</h3>
          <p>Create unlimited categories to organize different types of collectibles. Each category can have its own name and description.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Item Tracking</h3>
          <p>Track each collectible with a unique serial number, name, description, and high-quality image.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Image Upload</h3>
          <p>Upload images up to 50MB with drag-and-drop functionality. Images are stored securely on Shopify's CDN.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Verification System</h3>
          <p>Customers can verify authenticity by entering their serial number - no account needed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Edit Anytime</h3>
          <p>Update item details, change images, or mark items as inactive whenever you need.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Verification Logs</h3>
          <p>Track when and how often items are verified for analytics and fraud prevention.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Managing Categories</h2>
      <h3>Creating a Category</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Click "Categories" in the main navigation</li>
        <li>Click "Create Category"</li>
        <li>Enter a name (e.g., "Rare Trading Cards")</li>
        <li>Add an optional description</li>
        <li>Set display order for sorting</li>
        <li>Click "Save"</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Editing a Category</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Navigate to the Categories page</li>
        <li>Click "Edit" on the category you want to modify</li>
        <li>Make your changes</li>
        <li>Click "Save Changes"</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Managing Items</h2>
      <h3>Adding an Item</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Navigate to a category</li>
        <li>Click "Add Item"</li>
        <li>Enter item name (required)</li>
        <li>Enter unique serial number (required)</li>
        <li>Add description (optional)</li>
        <li>Upload an image by dragging and dropping or clicking to browse</li>
        <li>Set active/inactive status</li>
        <li>Click "Add Item"</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Editing an Item</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>View items in a category</li>
        <li>Click "Edit" next to the item</li>
        <li>Modify any details</li>
        <li>Upload a new image if needed (optional - keeps old image if not changed)</li>
        <li>Click "Save Changes"</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Serial Numbers</h3>
      <p>Serial numbers must be unique across your entire store. They can contain letters, numbers, and special characters. Examples:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><code>CARD-2024-001</code></li>
        <li><code>AUTO-SMITH-12345</code></li>
        <li><code>LTD-ED-999</code></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Image Guidelines</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Supported formats:</strong> JPG, JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP</li>
        <li><strong>Maximum size:</strong> 50MB per image</li>
        <li><strong>Recommended dimensions:</strong> At least 800x800 pixels for best quality</li>
        <li><strong>Upload methods:</strong> Drag-and-drop or click to browse</li>
        <li><strong>Storage:</strong> Images are securely stored on Shopify's CDN</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Subscription Plans</h2>
      <h3>Basic - $9.99/month</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Up to 2 categories</li>
        <li>Unlimited items per category</li>
        <li>Full verification system</li>
        <li>Image uploads</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Pro - $29.99/month</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Up to 5 categories</li>
        <li>Unlimited items per category</li>
        <li>Full verification system</li>
        <li>Image uploads</li>
        <li>Priority support</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Premium - $49.99/month</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Unlimited categories</li>
        <li>Unlimited items</li>
        <li>Full verification system</li>
        <li>Image uploads</li>
        <li>Premium support</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Troubleshooting</h2>

      <h3>Image upload fails</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Check that your image is under 50MB</li>
        <li>Ensure you're using a supported format (JPG, PNG, GIF, WebP)</li>
        <li>Try a different browser if issues persist</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Can't create more categories</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Check your current plan limits</li>
        <li>Upgrade your plan if you need more categories</li>
        <li>Delete inactive categories to free up space</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Duplicate serial number error</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Each serial number must be unique across your entire store</li>
        <li>Check if the serial number already exists</li>
        <li>Use a different serial number format if needed</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-section">
      <h2>Need Help?</h2>
      <p>Our support team is here to help!</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <strong>Email:</strong> support@verifymycollectible.com<br>
        <strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 24 hours<br>
        <strong>Hours:</strong> Monday - Friday, 9am - 5pm EST
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <a href="/faq" style="color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">View FAQ</a> |
        <a href="/privacy" style="color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Privacy Policy</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
